sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User (UI)
    participant M as MAUI App
    participant DB as SQLite (Local)
    participant B as Sync BackgroundWorker
    participant API as Cloud API
    participant CDB as SQL Server (Cloud)

    U->>M: Create/Edit Pet
    M->>DB: Save Pet (Local)
    M->>DB: Add OutboxMessage (Register/Update)
    DB-->>M: Saved Locally
    M-->>U: Success (No Network Required)

    loop Every X seconds or Connectivity Restored
        B->>DB: Read Pending OutboxMessages
        alt Is Online
            B->>API: HTTP POST /api/v1/sync { Payload }
            API->>CDB: Process Command (Update Cloud DB)
            CDB-->>API: Success
            API-->>B: 200 OK
            B->>DB: Mark OutboxMessage as Synced / Remove
        else Is Offline
            B-->>B: Wait for next cycle (Retain locally)
        end
    end
